{"id":1110801,"name":"Dove - Interrogation I","type":"Interrogation","scenes":[{"id":1,"name":"Dove - Interrogation I","code_name":"","dialogue_ids":[1110801]}],"trial":{"trial_id":110801,"stage":"Phase 1","unlock_time":"2024-12-31 14:00:00","diary1":"Dove's interrogation is scheduled for tomorrow, but your investigation has yielded little progress since her innocent facade remains impenetrable. However, you are interrupted by yet another unexpected visitor...\nA certain businessman who has learned of Dove's abilities floods you with requests, hoping to use her forged letters for profit. Perhaps this intrusion could instead do you a favor.","diary2":"Dove's interrogation proves easier than expected. After several tense talks, you finally break through her facade and uncover what lies beneath—a deep disillusionment from a broken dream.\nIt's raw, genuine, and firmly ingrained, a frustration not easily dispelled in the short term. So you shift tactics. The businessman, who seems to share Dove's so-called \"values\" might be the key to prying open her defense.","evidence":[{"ID":260683,"Num":1}],"usable_items":[{"ID":260684,"Num":1}],"reward":[{"ID":240001,"Num":50}],"obey_award":100,"qte_failure":0,"failure_step":0,"graph":[{"step":1,"course":2,"dialogue_id":210801001,"next":null},{"step":2,"course":2,"dialogue_id":210801002,"next":null},{"step":3,"course":2,"dialogue_id":210801003,"next":null},{"step":4,"course":2,"dialogue_id":210801004,"next":null},{"step":5,"course":2,"dialogue_id":210801005,"next":null},{"step":6,"course":2,"dialogue_id":210801006,"next":null},{"step":7,"course":2,"dialogue_id":210801007,"next":null},{"step":8,"course":2,"dialogue_id":210801008,"next":null},{"step":9,"course":2,"dialogue_id":210801009,"next":null},{"step":10,"course":2,"dialogue_id":210801010,"next":null},{"step":11,"course":2,"dialogue_id":210801011,"next":null},{"step":12,"course":2,"dialogue_id":210801012,"next":null},{"step":13,"course":2,"dialogue_id":210801013,"next":null},